{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/1c396d18b8157a0b58ce3792a9a8d584.png?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you wake up, you suddenly find yourself back in time, you have a vague memory, you don't know why you are here, and in the process of escaping, you may discover the truth hidden behind this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/6a845a6637abcd4a8e7aa9d745ba0272.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game requires players to explore different scenarios to trigger and find out different events and solve the mysteries around them step by step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/a72341bd8242a5e55658e17e80324e53.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, it is also necessary to pay attention to the different people around you, talk to them to find out what the problem is, and require the player to judge right and wrong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/9fcc77efd637ba866bea303927b14ab2.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also a variety of events and texts for the player to explore, which will help the player understand that they are in the world and influence their choices, and escape from it step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/c5f51d67bce53951b75933846427cb11.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's choice will lead to the triggering of different endings, and it is irreversible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/4065ac00f57687c223b46d0acc937efa.png?t=1745042810\" />Players will also have to be careful as they explore and watch out for monster chases, which will tear apart your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/272ae11e2d9a87ed4e767d08a8f568e0.png?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player also pays attention to the changes that occur in the scene in order to find a way out</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649610?t=1745042810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/57c698b534a6986c747ac3a9526b2a6c8a55bae5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745042810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/d4bade00ae68d8bdd31693e86218de8380aad449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745042810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/d4bade00ae68d8bdd31693e86218de8380aad449/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745042810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/1c396d18b8157a0b58ce3792a9a8d584.png?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you wake up, you suddenly find yourself back in time, you have a vague memory, you don't know why you are here, and in the process of escaping, you may discover the truth hidden behind this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/6a845a6637abcd4a8e7aa9d745ba0272.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game requires players to explore different scenarios to trigger and find out different events and solve the mysteries around them step by step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/a72341bd8242a5e55658e17e80324e53.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, it is also necessary to pay attention to the different people around you, talk to them to find out what the problem is, and require the player to judge right and wrong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/9fcc77efd637ba866bea303927b14ab2.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also a variety of events and texts for the player to explore, which will help the player understand that they are in the world and influence their choices, and escape from it step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/c5f51d67bce53951b75933846427cb11.jpg?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's choice will lead to the triggering of different endings, and it is irreversible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/4065ac00f57687c223b46d0acc937efa.png?t=1745042810\" />Players will also have to be careful as they explore and watch out for monster chases, which will tear apart your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/extras/272ae11e2d9a87ed4e767d08a8f568e0.png?t=1745042810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player also pays attention to the changes that occur in the scene in order to find a way out</p>","developers":["GUGUQI"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/b2e63e8c88598527e831e454f8e3ea34a49c3392/header.jpg?t=1745042810","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125237,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125237/movie480.mp4?t=1744936563","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125237/movie_max.mp4?t=1744936563"},"name":"Before waking up ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125237/37c227e303e07d15618d8c3278b43777ac752c28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744936563","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125237/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744936563","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125237/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744936563"}}],"name":"Before waking up (\u68a6\u9192\u8fb9\u7f18)","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> window7</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["GUGUQI"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/b0bc8e88916701f53f791a633e39bc49363159bf/ss_b0bc8e88916701f53f791a633e39bc49363159bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745042810","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649610/b0bc8e88916701f5